            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nairriwaa apa nanu ilkiliku teina ong'ata e Kedemot airriwaki Sihon olaiguanani le Heshbon, too rorei le seriani, ajoki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Nchooki nanu maimai atua enkop ino; enkoitoi ake aim nanu, nemaiwuang nanu alo enkaina e tatene aashu ene kedienye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eikimiraki iyie nanu endaa too mpisai, pee atum ainosa, nikincho nanu enkare too ropiyiani, pee atum atooko; nchooki ake duoo iyie enaimaa too nkejek, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anaa apa enaitaasa nanu ilayiok le Esau oomanya Seir o Lmoabu oomanya Ari, o metaba anaa nalang alo lido kekun le Yordan ajing atua ina kop naishoo iyiook Olaitoriani Enkai ang.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eitu eisho iyiook Sihon olaiguanani le Heshbon matogiroi ninye, amu eitagolo Olaitoriani Enkai inyi oltau lenye pee etum ninye aishoru atipika enkaina inyi anaa ena olong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki nanu Olaitoriani, ‘Ng'ura, aiterua nanu aisho intae Sihon o enkop enye; enteru ewaita, pee itumutumu aatamany ena kop.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu Sihon aarare iyiook, ninye o ltung'ana lenyena pooki, neitayu olarrabal te Yahas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishoru Olaitoriani Enkai ang ninye, nikimir iyiook ninye, o layiok lenyena, o ltung'ana lenyena pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikimbung iyiook nkanas enyena teina kata nikindaikie tukul pooki anasa, ilewa, o nkituaak, o nkera; meetae hoo obo otung'uayioki eishu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkishu kiwaita aaraya tenebo iyarunot e nena anas nikimbung'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ebaiki Aroer naa ninye natii embata o erata le Arnon, o ebaiki ina anasa natii oerata ometabaiki Gilead meetae enkanasa nalusoo te iyiook; eishorua Olaitoriani Enkai ang pooki apik atua nkaik ang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina kop pooki ake oo layiok le Amon eitu inyikakiki, aa taa, inkiyopat o lkeju le Yaboko o nkanas eina kop oo ldoinyo, o pooki wueji neitanapa iyiook Olaitoriani Enkai ang ajoki emipuo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
